    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nViewings suspended.\n\n \n\nREA MURPHY BRINGS WHAT IS A BEAUTIFUL FAMILY HOME, TO THE OPEN MARKET FOR IMMEDIATE SALE. IF YOU ARE SEEKING A QUALITY PROPERTY IN BLESSINGTON, CONSIDER THE FOLLOWING:\n\nThis delightful home is located in the established Downshire Park development, a short walk from Blessington Town centre and walking distance to the local primary and secondary schools. The property is on a short cul-de-sac and fronts an expansive, leafy open space, bringing a true sense of maturity to the immediate location very child friendly.\n\nNo. 3 The Dale offers off-street parking to the front, a wider than usual side entrance to the rear garden and a totally enclosed and mature rear garden. Inside the home there is very well laid out accommodation throughout. The spacious Lounge interconnects to the open-plan Kitchen and Living area, and all of the ground floor is awash with natural light. 3 Bedrooms are at 1st floor, and the larger sized bedrooms is immediately evident, which are presented in excellent condition. The accommodation also includes the Bathroom, En Suite and downstairs W.C.\n\nThe Downshire Park development is on the Blessington Ring Road with easy access to the N81 route to Dublin 24 (19Km) or to the R410 route to Naas Town (10Km). Public transport links from the Blessington Main Street to Dublin and Naas. Within the town of Blessington there is a wide choice of retail shops and services, with Dunnes Stores, SuperValu and Aldi on your doorstep. Locally there is a range of sporting clubs and recreational activities to choose from Blessington Lakes has Sailing and Rowing clubs and a choice of golf clubs within a 10-minute drive, in addition to the local GAA and Soccer clubs. With a strong emphasis on outdoor pursuits, Blessington is a top-rated location for family life.\n\nContact REA MURPHY for a viewing appointment.\n\n \n\nACCOMMODATION:\nEntrance Hall.\n\nLounge.\n\nKitchen with Living and Dining areas.\n\nDownstairs W.C.\n\n1st Floor:\n\nMaster Bedroom with En Suite.\n\nDouble Bedroom.\n\nBathroom.\n\nSingle Bedroom.\n\n \n\nOUTSIDE:\nLow maintenance Cobblelock driveway and parking area.\n\nPedestrian side entrance.\n\nEnclosed rear garden.\n\n \n\nSERVICES:\n\nGas fired central heating.\n\nFitted alarm.\n\nExcellent broadband available.\n\n \n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Super 3-Bed family home available immediately (no chain).\nMature, child-friendly location within walking distance from Blessington Town centre.\nSpacious Bedrooms and a large inter-connecting living area.\nEnclosed rear gardens with established shrubbery and lawn.\nOff-street parking on the property, and a cul-de-sac location. \nAvailable subject to the sale of a property if required.\nPublic transport links to Dublin City and Naas Town."
